      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I see that these posts got merged. I feel like the other post had a bit of a different take. This post makes it sound like the bug is that locally the avatar isnt clamped and that it should be clamped. The merged post was more approaching it from the angle that remote users see the avatar clamped and that that  behaviour shouldn't be the case.\n\nPersonally i think the avatar shouldn't be clamped for manually uploaded sizes at all unless a world activity sets the size through udon.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
