      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62def6a8e106a844b4e47630|full_name}: The last official word that was given, to my recollection, was that you should be able to upload and use avatars that are beyond the normal caps, assuming there is no restriction being set on the world. (I have other issues with worlds having final say in private instances but that's not the scope of this bug report)\n\nRegardless, irrespective of VRChat's stance, there's no logical intended reason for the local and remote player to see two different sizes, so this pretty much has to be a bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
