      "value": "I just found about this bug report.\n\nIt looks like it's related to my issue at https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/avatars-between-1-10cm-are-not-replicated-correctly\n\nI really want a solution that doesn't limit us even further. Super small or super large avatars are not an issue as long as people are fine with them in an instance. If a world really wants to set a hard limit, they should be able to do with udon.\n\n**Please remove the remote user height clamping completely because it is just doing nothing but breaking things right now.**",
